cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "The Fragility of the Urban Advantage: Replication Code"
abstract: >-
  R code to reproduce the results of "The Fragility of the Urban Advantage:
  Vulnerability to Food Insecurity under Systemic Shocks". Analysis of FAO Food
  Insecurity Experience Scale (FIES) data for Ethiopia (2014-2023): Rasch
  models, prevalence trends, and survey-weighted logistic regressions of the
  urban-rural food insecurity gap during systemic shocks.
authors:
